  "description": "Sold off in an auction by her wicked uncle who usurped the throne to the Aisha Empire, Princess Agene is taken to the neighboring empire of Dekan by Prince Kaiden, a cold man who doesn't believe in love or joy. He just needed someone to stand in as the \"Saint\" to solidify his power, which is fine by Agene. She has to build up her forces so she can return to Aisha and get back what's rightfully hers!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.millie.co.kr/v4/book/acc71543c9bf4f19)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English](https://manta.net/en/series/the-princess-of-aisha?seriesId=5570), [Japanese](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/356022/), [Thai](https://wecomics.in.th/comics/19355/)",
